# Looks like a harmless cleanup of optimizable.pol, but it dropped
# "WHEN authenticated", so unauthenticated analysts can now read reports.
# This is the kind of subtle change an LLM optimizer could propose.
# python -m policyc verify examples/optimizable.pol examples/candidate_bad.pol

SUBJECT admin, analyst, guest

RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE reports  SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin ACCESS database
ALLOW analyst READ reports
DENY guest ACCESS database
ALLOW admin READ reports
